## Required reading before performance-sensitive code

| Doc | Trigger |
|---|---|
| `DOCS/STRATEGY_AND_CODING_RULES.md` | any code in hot path, slow path, OMS drainer, parsing, ML inference, strategies. 11 strict invariants. |
| `DOCS/LATENCY_OPTIMIZATION_AUDIT.md` | any optimization investigation, performance-regression triage. 13 parts. |
| `plans/_cross-cutting/2026-05-06-latency-path-discipline.md` | any modification to latency-impacting path. 7 architectural rules scaled by cadence + anti-pattern history + pre-merge checklist. |
| `DOCS/DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY.md` | cold-pickup of unfamiliar surface; designing non-trivial change; cross-family trade-off; new pattern codification. 14 sections with cross-ref index. |

Workflow: rules doc first → audit doc for "yes but how" → hot-path
discipline when touching per-tick code → philosophy doc when
designing rather than implementing.

