**Private (workspace-backed):** plans/, .claude/skills/,
engine.cfg / backtest.cfg / controller.cfg / secrets.cfg, models/,
runtime logs + per-symbol metrics CSVs + baseline_run/,
`DOCS/LATENCY_OPTIMIZATION_AUDIT.md`,
`DOCS/STRATEGY_AND_CODING_RULES.md`, `*-design-notes.md`,
`FUTURE_*.md`, all `*_AUDIT.md`, this file.

**Public (AGPL on GitHub):** all source in `CoreFrameworks/`,
`Strategies/`, `ML_Headers/`, `Backtest/`, `DataStream/`,
`FixedPoint/`, `MemHeaders/`, `GUI/`; tracked `DOCS/` (architecture,
invariants, code map, changelogs, known issues, parity docs,
recurring-bug patterns, public design history); tests; build
infrastructure; `CLAUDE.md`.

